+1. Locate the prior trail. A resume note in `<root>/.nstack/resume/`, a local transcript in this workspace's transcript folder, `~/.claude/projects/<slug>/`, where `~/.claude` is `$CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR` when that is set and `<slug>` is the workspace path with each character other than a letter, digit, or `-` changed to `-` (do not glob across `~/.cursor/projects/*/`, that crosses workspace boundaries and reads private chats from unrelated projects), a session URL, or a pushed branch. Read the metadata overview and last messages first, then scan back for the decision points. Parse a long transcript in a subagent and keep the reduced timeline in the main thread (the **principle-guard-the-context-window** skill). Pick each subagent's reasoning level for the job, per the Subagents section.
